The '''Ancient Tablet''' is one of the [[Into the Future]] [[Treasure]]s. It increases the health of the [[Cat Base]]. Its effect is identical to that of the [[Smart Material Wall]] in [[Empire of Cats]], and like all Treasures, the two are able to stack with each other.

==Effect==
Each Ancient Tablet increases the [[Cat Base]]'s health by a maximum +7,000.

When a player has activated Ancient Tablet at 100% in all three chapters, the Cat Base's health is increased by +21,000.

